- GET/POST /admin   -> needs session admin; body JSON {key,value}; type(key) is str and '_.' not in key; pydash.set_(Pollute(), key, value)  (prototype pollution; need path-parse bypass, e.g. bracket notation, to write __globals__ w/o '_.')
